     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">晉維,</span><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Please try:  考慮CSV資料中, 第1行為列名稱, 則使用read.table時, 加上 <b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">row.names=<font color=\"#ff0000\">1</font></font></b> 表示第<font color=\"#ff0000\">1</font>行為列名稱即可. </span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">詳細可參考 <font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>?read.table</b></font> 線上說明.</span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/attach/aa0abe9da548d/row.names.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"row.names.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"340\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">pdta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pdta.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> row</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></span> <br>張晉維於 2019年7月1日星期一 UTC+8下午6時43分36秒寫道：</div></div>"
